  0 exch R
  Blacktext {gsave 0 setgray MFshow grestore} {MFshow} ifelse } bind def
/MRshow { currentpoint stroke M
  exch dup MFwidth neg 3 -1 roll R
  Blacktext {gsave 0 setgray MFshow grestore} {MFshow} ifelse } bind def
